{"server":"tw","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_06_end","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_06","title":"華爾滋“假面”","storyCode":"ZT-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"7df0ffed076ac5205987d86ba3733d0e7f71b5a6795e20916e5c0ccf994b97c6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封住下樓的通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各個小隊，全力搜尋那個薩科塔。不能讓她進入塔前劇場，干擾金律樂章的演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，目標的源石技藝非常特殊。根據女皇的命令，一旦發現她，可以立刻重創甚至處決——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好。您是在找我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——屏障！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"列陣，抓住她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅·吉亞洛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是拉特蘭人，卻被拉特蘭通緝。是萊塔尼亞接納了你。因為你有著非凡的音樂才能，所以無數貴族將你視為座上賓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在萊塔尼亞，你幾乎與高塔貴族享有同樣的權利，這都是女皇賜予你的恩典。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻回去，停止與女皇作對，她們或許能恩准你繼續活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這從來……都不是一個可選項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我活著，又不能繼續自由演奏的話，那和死去又有什麼分別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就接受你的死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的法術……變強了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你選錯了越獄的時機，薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章奏響了。你看到外面盛大的景象了嗎？沐浴在萊塔尼亞金色的光輝之中，你那些小小的誘發混亂的伎倆派不上任何用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我能感覺到，你們的意志前所未有地堅定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……到底是你的意志在演繹這首曲子，還是旋律說服了你，讓你相信自己的所見符合所想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不重要，黃金的旋律引領著我，我的意志正與旋律共鳴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，我們的敵人，你注定將要融化在萊塔尼亞的光輝之中——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是幻覺嗎？可並沒有琴聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，為什麼你們總是以為我能製造幻覺呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我明明提醒過的。當你的情感被不屬於自己的旋律掌控的時候，你會很容易忽視眼前的真實……比如，我在“光輝”之中走到了哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身後……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屏障！來不及——!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我想請您解開我的琴上附著的小小法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在它終於變乾淨了，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們怎麼會……輸給你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本不足以與你們對抗，但你們的心靈因金律樂章的束縛而變得僵硬，你們的法術也變得漏洞百出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為……什麼？擁有這樣的源石技藝，你本可以改寫自己的命運，擁有無盡的名利，無上的恩寵……與女皇作對，到底有什麼意義……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意義……嗎？您理解的意義，恐怕與我想要的截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"名聲、財富、高人一等的地位，都是一層裹在心靈之外的皮囊，注定隨著時間流逝而朽爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我而言，選帝侯還是乞丐，又或是我自己……我們的差異都只在心聲不同而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想走到最高的塔頂，是為了一段旋律，一顆心靈，一個未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是……為了對一位朋友的承諾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳說中當巫王在塔頂演奏的時候，就連天上的雲都會因為他的法術而駐足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在想……雲會記得那座塔的樣子嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師曾無數次對我描繪過，巫王塔還在的時候，他作為皇家樂團的大提琴手，站在塔下，為萊塔尼亞唯一的君主奏響樂章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那個時候，金紅色的雲霞簇擁著漆黑的塔，如同為它披上了一件最為華貴的衣袍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他很想回到這裡來，再見一次這壯麗的情景。可惜……他沒有資格參加女皇慶典，甚至無法輕易地走出居所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來與老師告別的人很少，而真心實意地為他落淚的……只有您一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……感謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這樣的琴聲，依舊無法為老師帶去任何安慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他生前，我曾經主動提出過為他演奏。他拒絕了我。在最痛苦消沉的時光裡，他拒絕緬懷過去的快樂，也不再尋求任何改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只願意把自己關在房間裡，一遍遍地演奏金律樂章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那不變的旋律中，他感受著萊塔尼亞的壯美與崇高，終於忘記了愛與恨，也忘記了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在面對死亡時，他的內心還是充滿了……遺憾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不……往下走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對這種“演奏會”可沒什麼興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些有意約束著聽眾意志的旋律，只是另一種律法罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的術式雖然複雜，但對熟悉源石技藝與音樂的人而言，還是清晰可見的。這一點倒是和拉特蘭的律法不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音樂本該是人們的心靈自由呼吸時發出的聲響，你們卻反過來將它變成了秩序的一部分，用以控制人們的意志，消磨人們的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而人的心靈與心靈之間，真正的聯結……正越來越微弱。人們變得更不能互相理解，更不尊重另一個人的情感，進而相互傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣僵化的旋律，不配被稱為樂章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多快到塔頂了。趁這首曲子還沒有結束，該準備迎接下一首了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的約定也差不多快實現了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你告訴我的一樣，這個位置確實很不錯，無論是演奏……還是傾聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要道歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾乎沒有人主動邀請我演奏他們的心聲，他們甚至避之不及。你卻願意像這樣對我袒露內心……我很高興，也很感激。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我的琴聲因你的心聲而動，它決定不了你會想起什麼。我能做的不過是感受你的情感，並讓它呈現在我們面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……是和雕塑差不多。我發現，記錄，而不是改變一個人真實的形貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之所以無法進入你回憶中的巫王塔，只有一個原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每當你回憶巫王的死，最能調動你情感的……是一隻手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻抓著你，穿梭在法術洪流中的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是誰的手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是誰的手？\n那是……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人正在一個接著一個地冒出來，我和費德里科先生會盡量擋住他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的眼睛看不見，可能會受接下來的戰鬥波及。別離開我身邊，拉住我的手，好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你和他，真的太像了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說……父親？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年的巫王塔下，他也是像這樣抓著我……抓著我這個素未謀面的小侍從的手，護著我穿過一波又一波法術的轟擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……巫王死去的那一晚，您的確也在那座塔裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您沒有告訴過我，您和父親是這樣相識的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時的我……剛失去視力。我趴在塌了一半的台階下面，巫王的禁軍，追隨雙子的軍隊……都不會在意我這個侍從的死活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是來自施彤領的一支隊伍發現了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領著那支軍隊的人就是沃爾納，他帶人來找在巫王塔裡失蹤的父兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明已經那麼著急了，他還是無法對瑟瑟發抖的我視而不見，親自動手把我從廢墟裡拉了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……父親是會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都是好人，很好很好的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的手……為什麼要捂住我的耳朵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，別怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別怕……會過去的。什麼都會過去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樂章變了。是變了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼變得……這麼難聽？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的頭……我的頭，誰在攻擊我？誰把一萬隻聒噪的羽獸塞進了我腦袋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這煙火，這該死的，五顏六色，俗不可耐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不該這樣，完全不對。是我吹錯音符了嗎？是所有人都出錯了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施彤領來的先生，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別碰我——! 我不知道你是誰，也不想知道！是不是你吹錯了音？是不是你想破壞……破壞什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔——嘔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是旋律出錯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這怎麼可能？怎麼會這麼多人一齊出錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是普通出錯的話……又為何會造成這麼痛苦的結果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看雙子女皇塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他。是赫爾昏佐倫。我不可能看錯。他的力量正在蠶食著金律樂章！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王殘黨……巫王殘黨在哪裡？！我就知道他們沒有死絕，哈哈哈，萊辛，我們該戰鬥了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你沒有受影響？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受這些小小烏雲的影響？你知道我過去每天忍受的都是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……反倒是金律樂章本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它讓我懷念起了烏提卡。這真的很不對勁……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是樂章的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樂章定義了萊塔尼亞……決定了萊塔尼亞人的審美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不樂意由誰來規定我需要懷念什麼，熱愛什麼，歌頌什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但想在這裡破壞樂章演奏的人，應該不會只是想搞一齣鬧劇，博塔上的女皇和崔林特爾梅外的大貴族們一笑吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意，左邊有敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必提醒。你那邊也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒想到還有人能保持清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，拜你們強塞給我的垃圾所賜，混亂和痛楚早就和我的大腦難捨難分了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……幹得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過別人都這麼痛苦了，你怎麼還跟往常一樣沒什麼表情？萊辛·梅耶爾先生，我開始懷疑你會不會也是巫妖煉出來的木頭人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小到大所接受的訓練，都是為了應對類似的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章的崩潰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請告訴我，你不是在一本正經地說笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到劇場邊緣……正在升起來的金色光輝了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有見過，這麼多金律法衛同時在場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇的命令——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圍住恩典大道和威權大道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕不能讓被污染的金律樂章蔓延開去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼多金律法衛……還有憲兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快整個雙塔區都會被封鎖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈沒用的，晚了，早就晚了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫回來了，我們唯一的陛下，重新降臨於他的萊塔尼亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請安靜點吧，好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉，能不能答應我……先什麼都別說，也什麼都別做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們來的人太多了。每一個法衛都很強大，不輸給冠軍騎士。如果只有布蘭特閣下一個人的話，或許我可以試一試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼還不說話？帷幕即將揭開，我們何必躲藏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的夙願，我們的渴望，我們奉獻自己的鮮血與心智求來的時刻——就要到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的臉上……為什麼看不見絲毫喜悅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要，再說話了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在去找阿爾圖羅小姐之前，我去了一趟金盞花小巷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來是想去再看一眼那些畫的。畫上的那些……過去的影像，令我感到溫暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我什麼都沒找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的畫作，畫著金盞花的，還有留有巫王相關訊息的，全都不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是您帶走了它們，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來只需要帶走有訊息的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我……同樣放不下那些與金盞花有關的過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……當您親口告訴我，巫王死去的那一夜，您也在現場的時候，我就知道，我沒有猜錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時，您沒有將整幅畫作上覆蓋的源石顏料清理乾淨。沒有完全展露的畫作上，其實留有您的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王殘黨在追逐著巫王之死的見證者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您……也是其中之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您與那些死去的無辜者不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……不想說這些的。我甚至不想問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這一次，為什麼……不能讓我稍稍自私一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很抱歉，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……我才剛剛得到，就又要逼我失去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該一起戰鬥，首席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律法衛都到場了。我們走了這麼遠，這時候死在他們手上很可惜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你相信金律樂章會徹底變調嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只關注結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次改寫金律樂章的……是赫爾昏佐倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就連他，都沒有想毀掉樂章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章是萊塔尼亞秩序的根基。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從每個人對審美的感受，使用源石技藝的習慣與方法，到選帝侯制度，皇帝的權力……一旦樂章被毀，這些所有的前提都可能被顛覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候，萊塔尼亞將迎來前所未有的變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是變化……變化未必都是壞的。要不然，我們甚至都不會出生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一對誕生於術式的孩子，只是違背了自然規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“這僅是個開端。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗萊蒙特就是這麼對利奧波德說的。當時我們還在襁褓之中，可我知道，你和我一樣聽懂了他們的交談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從生下來就帶著使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從生下來就注定了要改變萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利奧波德害怕著我們。所以他準備好了一整支軍隊，打算在利用我們殺死赫爾昏佐倫之後，就從背後將我們撕碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可最後我們還是活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……並非我們選擇了降生，但既然擁有了生命，我們就有繼續活下去的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十三年前的那一天，我們站在這個位置……面對的是一樣的晚霞，不一樣的混亂情形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在開始那場萬眾期待的共奏之前，你對我……伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的晚霞並不屬於任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是赫爾昏佐倫的，不是利奧波德的，也不是任意一位選帝侯，或那些野心勃勃的大貴族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拉著我，我們一起走到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必等著向那些選帝侯復命……不必聽從任何人的擺布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們決定了自己的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯然……也有人懷揣著同樣的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人心真的很有意思啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人造的孩子，有了心之後，也會生出許多人的欲望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個看似弱小的人，憑著自己簡單到不能更簡單的心願，說不定能做到赫爾昏佐倫都做不到的事……重新定義萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想問我是否對珂拉有所放任，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這件事上，你不也一樣？我們的心意是相通的，即使我們已經很久沒有像這樣，兩個人在一起……看過這片晚霞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我們再一起看一下吧，大概也用不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來會變成什麼樣子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希爾德加德，你……還願意陪著我一起看嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首席，躲開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首席——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的法術，為什麼反過來……貫穿了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……調音？您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，埃米莉。我說過了，我的選擇沒有變過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……哈哈……其實，也沒什麼。我們的一生，都背叛過很多人，可能太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫的永恆之塔……就快……我在階梯上等著您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……首席。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃米莉應該在我面前化作了漆黑的煙塵。這是巫王殘黨的慣例，他們不願意讓自己的軀體留在這片不受赫爾昏佐倫注目的土地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們大多都死了，還在負隅頑抗的也堅持不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我大概也是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您欺騙了赫爾昏佐倫的信徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，成為巫王殘黨的“首席”，給予他們誘餌和希望，引他們自己步入深淵，是女皇交予我的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十三年了，關於巫王的一切，那些漫長的噩夢，深植的恐懼，無謂的野心，本就該從這個國度中徹底抹消。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但為什麼，“調音”還在繼續？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾納捲了進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是女皇逼死了父親嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我勸過他，勸了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想讓他交出金律樂章的副本，讓我轉移到另一個地方。可他擔心這會驚動巫王殘黨，使得誘餌失去作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又問他，能不能讓布蘭特提前過來，在襲擊現場救他一命……他還是拒絕了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，他早已病入膏肓，等待著死亡來領他與露辛達團聚。不過多活幾天而已，不值得牽連施彤領……還有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是只要多堅持幾小時……甚至只要一會，他就能等到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他離開得太決絕，放棄得太輕易，又太無可奈何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在沃爾納死去的那一天，我拿到了金律樂章的副本，看著你回到施彤領，走上又一條被安排好了的，與沃爾納那般相似的道路……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做出了這個在我心中醞釀已久的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……金律樂章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您利用赫爾昏佐倫的術式將樂章調了音。您正在摧毀樂章，或是說樂章施加於所有萊塔尼亞人心中的法術力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是都說，命運是看不見盡頭的螺旋樓梯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章就是困著萊塔尼亞的螺旋樓梯本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千年前的意志所鑄就的台階，再華貴優美，內裡也已朽爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年來，我遇到了太多受困的人。艾曼紐閣下，格哈德，弗里達，洛里斯……還有布蘭特，所有人都在被命運折磨，又無力改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王塔倒下了，更多高塔立了起來。塔下的人拼命地想爬到塔上，而塔上的人依然想去更高的塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一批又一批的人，來來去去，上上下下。仇恨循環往復，爭鬥永不止歇。痛苦，悔恨，遺憾……將佔據一代又一代萊塔尼亞人的心靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是，薇薇安娜。等你進入女皇塔，你的口中就只能發出女皇想要你發出的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能“看見”……我已經看見了。你會變得和你父親一樣，在不想要的生活中蹉跎一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章曲調不變，萊塔尼亞是不會改變的，未來還會有更多悲劇上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非，過時的樂章不再困住每一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說想要改變我們的命運，可是您憑什麼決定誰成為幸運兒，誰成為犧牲品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。我沒有資格，也沒有人該有這個資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要毀掉舊秩序，但新的秩序在哪裡，又是否一定會比昨天與今天的更好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。未來並不會握在我這樣的人手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那些死在這個計劃中的人……以及我們面前這些人，您注意不到他們所受的苦嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我都聽得到。周圍的哀嚎，死者的嘆息……他們都在我的心裡，在我死去之前，一刻都不會停息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼您非要做這個改變一切的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為……我可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為，您可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總要有人去做的。我的生命本就乏善可陳，僅剩一點……甚至未曾完全屬於我的光亮。為了讓它不要輕易熄滅，我什麼都會做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的殘酷，傲慢與不負責任……我都無法贊同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，我必須阻止您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"災難已經發生了，經由我的手。我害死了這麼多人，還有更多人正在因為我而走向死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到的。為了這一天，我已經……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道，我最不能贊同您的……是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是真的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……狠心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉，珂拉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_i10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是個貌似柔軟，但很堅定的孩子。你做不到在別人的痛苦面前背過身去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也不想看布蘭特為難。直到這一刻，你還在不斷地為別人考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且……我很高興，最後殺死我的，是我最愛的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天的雲，是不是很好看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，別怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"會過去的，什麼都……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那個孩子抱著我。\n我能感覺得到，她放在我後背上的手一直在顫抖。\n我很想像過去那樣把她抱進懷裡，好好地安慰她。我可能是這麼做了，即便我的身體正因失血而逐漸麻木，但我還是說了很多話。\n我能想像到那雙湖水般的眼睛裡一定已經下起了雨，那張溫柔的面龐也因為苦苦忍耐而皺了起來。\n她大概剛剛才知道，我其實沒有看清楚過她的父親和母親。\n關於他們倆的樣貌，他們是如何在金盞花小巷裡相識相愛的，我都是從沃爾納的描述中想像的。\n畢竟，從來到維杜尼亞的第一天起，我就進了那座漆黑的塔。而走出巫王塔的那一天，我已經看不清了。\n我所能感知到的所有生活的美好，包括布蘭特，都是沃爾納和露辛達帶給我的。\n唯獨一樣東西……唯獨這一樣。\n那天沃爾納牽著那個剛從高塔裡走出來的女孩來到我面前，當我觸摸到那隻柔軟的怯生生的手，當我為她拭乾淚水的時候……\n我就確信了這一點。\n我愛著這個孩子，不僅僅因為這是他們兩個的孩子。\n我在她的身上，看到的是我們這些人都沒有的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你值得過上更好的生活，薇薇安娜……如果真有的話……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
